    "content": "Somali President Hassan Sheikh Mohamud held a sideline meeting with Egyptian President Abdel Fattah el-Sisi on Saturday in the Egyptian city of Al-Alamein, according to a report by Goobjoog. The meeting took place during the Africa Business Forum, where both leaders were in attendance.\n\nThe two presidents discussed ways to strengthen bilateral relations between Somalia and Egypt, with particular emphasis on economic cooperation, investment, and development. The talks were part of a series of sideline meetings held by participating heads of state during the forum.\n\nThis meeting marks another step in the growing relationship between Mogadishu and Cairo. In recent years, the two countries have deepened their ties, signing agreements on trade, education, and security. Egypt has also been a key supporter of Somalia in regional affairs, including its bid to secure a non-permanent seat on the UN Security Council.\n\nThe Africa Business Forum, held in Al-Alamein, brings together African leaders, business executives, and policymakers to discuss ways to boost investment and trade across the continent. For the Somali diaspora, this meeting signals potential opportunities for increased economic engagement with Egypt, a country that hosts a significant Somali community and serves as a gateway for Somali businesses in North Africa.\n\nThe Somali diaspora, which contributes significantly to Somalia's economy through remittances and investments, stands to benefit from strengthened economic ties. Improved cooperation between Somalia and Egypt could lead to more favorable business environments, joint ventures, and investment opportunities in sectors such as agriculture, livestock, and energy.\n\nBoth leaders reaffirmed their commitment to advancing shared interests and exploring new avenues for collaboration. The meeting concluded with an agreement to continue dialogue and follow up on the discussed areas of cooperation. The outcome of these talks is expected to be closely watched by Somali entrepreneurs and diaspora investors looking to expand their operations in the region.\n\nRead the original report from Goobjoog here: https://goobjoog.com/2026/10/03/madaxweyne-xasan-sheekh-oo-kulan-doceed-la-qaatay-madaxweynaha-masar/",
